  title="Soft Washing Vinyl Siding: Pre-Treating Mold and Algae"
  description="What the green and black growth on vinyl siding is, why high-pressure washing alone doesn't last, and how a soft wash removes mold and algae."
  heading="Soft Washing Vinyl Siding: Why Mold and Algae Get Pre-Treated First"
  lede="Green film and black streaks on siding are living growth, not just dirt. Here's why blasting it off doesn't last, and how a pre-treatment soft wash works."
